:"cbr-p000722","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p040","chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m042-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"周苛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000722","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p042","chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:m009-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"周苛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000722","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:p009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-shiji011-007","subject_person_id":"cbr-p000951","predicate":"grandfather","object_person_id":"cbr-p000722","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi","source_id":"s-shiji-011-jingdi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:p009","quote":"中元年，封故御史大夫周苛孫平為繩侯，故御史大夫周昌（子）［孫］左車為安陽侯，四月乙巳，赦天下，賜爵一級。除禁錮。地動。衡山、原都雨雹，大者尺八寸。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"孫","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"僅保存來源明示關係，不補未見姓名、闕代或同父同母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji008-057","person_id":"cbr-p000722","surfaces":["周苛"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu","c-shiji-008-gaozu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p030","quote":"漢王使御史大夫周苛、樅公、魏豹守滎陽。周苛、樅公謀曰：「反國之王，難與守城。」乃共殺魏豹。楚下滎陽城，生得周苛。項王謂周苛曰：「為我將，我以公為上將軍，封三萬戶。」周苛罵曰：「若不趣降漢，漢今虜若，若非漢敵也。」項王怒，烹周苛，井殺樅公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p040","quote":"漢軍絕食，乃夜出女子東門二千餘人，被甲，楚因四面擊之。將軍紀信乃乘王駕，詐為漢王，誑楚，楚皆呼萬歲，之城東觀，以故漢王得與數十騎出西門遁。令御史大夫周苛、魏豹、樅公守滎陽。諸將卒不能從者，盡在城中。周苛、樅公相謂曰：「反國之王，難與守城。」因殺魏豹。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p042","quote":"項羽聞漢王在宛，果引兵南。漢王堅壁不與戰。是時彭越渡睢水，與項聲、薛公戰下邳，彭越大破楚軍。項羽乃引兵東擊彭越。漢王亦引兵北軍成皋。項羽已破走彭越，聞漢王復軍成皋，乃復引兵西，拔滎陽，誅周苛、樅公，而虜韓王信，遂圍成皋。"}],"rationale":"只在所列原句的秦末楚漢軍事／分封敘事內暫定同指；有前卷錨點時對讀相接事件，不把同名作全庫匹配規則，仍待異源覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji011-002","person_id":"cbr-p000722","surfaces":["周苛"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-007-xiangyu","c-shiji-011-jingdi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p030","quote":"漢王使御史大夫周苛、樅公、魏豹守滎陽。周苛、樅公謀曰：「反國之王，難與守城。」乃共殺魏豹。楚下滎陽城，生得周苛。項王謂周苛曰：「為我將，我以公為上將軍，封三萬戶。」周苛罵曰：「若不趣降漢，漢今虜若，若非漢敵也。」項王怒，烹周苛，井殺樅公。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-011-jingdi:p009","quote":"中元年，封故御史大夫周苛孫平為繩侯，故御史大夫周昌（子）［孫］左車為安陽侯，四月乙巳，赦天下，賜爵一級。除禁錮。地動。衡山、原都雨雹，大者尺八寸。"}],"rationale":"所列景帝朝職事、分封、家族與前卷接任敘事暫定相接；同名不作全庫替換，未名者不補姓名，仍待異源覆核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p030","text":"漢王使御史大夫周苛、樅公、魏豹守滎陽。周苛、樅公謀曰：「反國之王，難與守城。」乃共殺魏豹。楚下滎陽城，生得周苛。項王謂周苛曰：「為我將，我以公為上將軍，封三萬戶。」周苛罵曰：「若不趣降漢，漢今虜若，若非漢敵也。」項王怒，烹周苛，井殺樅公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m030-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m030-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"周苛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000722","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m030-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"樅公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000723","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m030-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"魏豹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000697","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m030-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"周苛","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000722","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m030-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"樅公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000723","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m030-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"魏豹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000697","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m030-0053","start":53,"end":55,"sur